      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a case where novice users FREQUENTLY drop a portal and don’t understand why not everyone can see it. It’s very confusing and disruptive, and an “under the hood” feeling to the setting. Since novice users are often attendees or special guests for events, this can be extremely obnoxious. Please make unlocked the default, or force a deliberate and intuitive choice when dropping a portal via pop-up.",
